\fs36 \cf0 1. Project Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Act as a senior full-stack mobile application developer, software architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, and QA engineer.\
Build a production-ready dairy business management application named 
\f0\b Shreeram Daily Milk
\f1\b0 .\
The application will be used by a dairy business owner (Admin) and milk delivery workers to manage customers, daily doorstep milk deliveries, delivery records, milk quantities, monthly bills, and customer payment tracking.\
The application must work reliably even when a delivery worker has no internet connection. Delivery records must be saved locally and synchronized automatically with the central database when internet connectivity returns.\
In the future, the business owner must be able to launch a website using the same backend and database. Any change made through the mobile app or website must be reflected across both platforms.\
Do not build only a UI prototype. Implement real database operations, authentication, offline storage, synchronization, billing calculations, and tests.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

