\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Monthly billing calculation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 For every customer, calculate the bill using the actual billable quantity and the applicable historical price.\
Conceptually:\
Monthly delivery charges = sum of each billable delivery quantity \'d7 its applicable unit price.\
Then calculate:\
Net bill = delivery charges + approved adjustments \uc0\u8722  discounts, subject to the configured billing rules.\
Outstanding balance = previous outstanding balance + new charges \uc0\u8722  payments received \u8722  approved credits.\
Define the billing rules explicitly for missed deliveries, partial deliveries, cancelled deliveries, and unconfirmed deliveries. Do not charge a customer for milk that was not delivered merely because it was scheduled.\
Avoid double-counting deliveries across month boundaries.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

