\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 14. Supabase Row-Level Security and Security\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Enable Row-Level Security (RLS) on all tables containing business or personal data.\
Implement least-privilege policies:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls30\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Admins can access authorized business-wide records.\
\ls30\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Workers can access only assigned routes, relevant customers, and authorized delivery records.\
\ls30\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Workers cannot access all customer financial information.\
\ls30\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Workers cannot modify finalized bills or payment records.\
\ls30\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Unauthenticated users cannot access private business data.\
\ls30\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Users cannot assign themselves admin privileges.\
\ls30\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 User roles must be established through trusted administrative provisioning.\
\ls30\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Validate all important authorization decisions on the server.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 If the system is designed for one dairy business, enforce that business boundary consistently. If multi-business support is added later, introduce a business identifier and tenant isolation throughout the schema and RLS policies.\
Never assume that hiding a button in the UI is sufficient security.\
Use Supabase Auth correctly. Store session credentials using secure platform-appropriate storage. Do not log passwords, access tokens, or other secrets.\
Use Edge Functions or PostgreSQL functions where appropriate for sensitive operations, including synchronization validation, bill finalization, and payment recording.\
Do not expose privileged database credentials to React Native or browser clients.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

