\ls31\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Business settings.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The website and mobile app must use the same Supabase database and business rules.\
When the admin adds a customer through the website, the new customer should appear in the mobile app after synchronization.\
When a worker records a delivery through the mobile app, the record should appear on the website after successful synchronization.\
When the admin updates a price or route online, the relevant devices should receive the change when they synchronize.\
Use Supabase Realtime for appropriate online updates, but do not depend on Realtime as the only synchronization mechanism. Implement durable database queries and synchronization cursors so missed realtime events can be recovered.\
Keep business logic shared where practical, for example in a shared TypeScript package or server-side functions. Do not duplicate sensitive billing or authorization logic independently across platforms.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

